      "versionNonce": 127208207,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779181281288,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Create New User: \nAs An anonymous user\nI want to create a new user\nSo that a user is persisted\n\nAcceptance: The user provides an email and a password to firebase auth via\ncreateUserWithEmailAndPassword() in a signup view. firebase returns a successfull\nuserCredential object. our auth implementation also contains a reference to react\nnative AsyncStorage for persistence handling. user is then rerouted to home view. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "5Oxt0T9rBddcc3b3ohSHq",
      "originalText": "User Story - Create New User: \nAs An anonymous user\nI want to create a new user\nSo that a user is persisted\n\nAcceptance: The user provides an email and a password to firebase auth via createUserWithEmailAndPassword() in a signup view. firebase returns a successfull userCredential object. our auth implementation also contains a reference to react native AsyncStorage for persistence handling. user is then rerouted to home view. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
