      "updated": 1779183003007,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Custom Sorting Behaviour: \nAs A user\nI want to manipulate sorting behaviour\nSo that i get a more personalized difficulty experience. \n\nAcceptance: the user should be able to provide, or infer, custom sorting\nbehaviour for generating a deck state. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Hldh6hsygSBEIuEi-ITeX",
      "originalText": "User Story - Custom Sorting Behaviour: \nAs A user\nI want to manipulate sorting behaviour\nSo that i get a more personalized difficulty experience. \n\nAcceptance: the user should be able to provide, or infer, custom sorting behaviour for generating a deck state. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
