      "updated": 1779183025608,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Custom Card Values: \nAs A user\nI want to manipulate card values.\nSo that i get a more personalized scoring experience. \n\nAcceptance: the user should be able to provide, or update, scoring values\nfor any card in a deck. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "0T0X4xzt9Bv4qBGeYd70F",
      "originalText": "User Story - Custom Card Values: \nAs A user\nI want to manipulate card values.\nSo that i get a more personalized scoring experience. \n\nAcceptance: the user should be able to provide, or update, scoring values for any card in a deck. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "MA13Ox9Bq3Z_4j-dZpHLh",
