      "updated": 1779182911943,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Game State Represented on Game Board: \nAs A user\nI want to have a interactive view of the gamestate\nSo that i can manipulate the gamestate, based on the rules of solitaire. \n\nAcceptance: Game Board view should take in a game state, and render the\ncomplete state to the user. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "HZ_XLaE_vCQ2qL0NIZPMT",
      "originalText": "User Story - Game State Represented on Game Board: \nAs A user\nI want to have a interactive view of the gamestate\nSo that i can manipulate the gamestate, based on the rules of solitaire. \n\nAcceptance: Game Board view should take in a game state, and render the complete state to the user. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
