      "updated": 1779182805895,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Random Sorted Deck: \nAs A user\nI want to set up a randomly sorted deck of cards\nSo that it can be used by the game session to start a round of solitaire. \n\nAcceptance: initiating a game session should provide a valid random sorted deck\nobject, that represents the inital Deck state for this game session. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "tIgbK38TI-2T5l-gVuFzw",
      "originalText": "User Story - Random Sorted Deck: \nAs A user\nI want to set up a randomly sorted deck of cards\nSo that it can be used by the game session to start a round of solitaire. \n\nAcceptance: initiating a game session should provide a valid random sorted deck object, that represents the inital Deck state for this game session. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
