      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779182761715,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Create Game Session: \nAs A user\nI want to start a game session\nSo that it can keep the game state as i play\n\nAcceptance: user initiates a game session, with provided configuration. Game\nsession is initiated, and overrides the active game session, and creates a\nroute in Realtime database based on this sessions uuid. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "iBj4i2ewBjKFhGr-EELqZ",
      "originalText": "User Story - Create Game Session: \nAs A user\nI want to start a game session\nSo that it can keep the game state as i play\n\nAcceptance: user initiates a game session, with provided configuration. Game session is initiated, and overrides the active game session, and creates a route in Realtime database based on this sessions uuid. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
