      "originalText": "User Story - Guest / Trial User: \nAs An Anonymous User\nI want to test the app\nSo that i can make a decision wether or not to apply. \n\nAcceptance:  a guest user should be able to naviage a limited guest view representing a limited app experience. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
