      "updated": 1779181953973,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Invalidate Session Token: \nAs An existing user\nI want to invalidate my session token, after a set amount of inactivity\nSo that if other people access the device, they can't log in passively on my account. \n\nAcceptance: firebase handles invaldation of session token in AsyncStorage. If user\nhas an invalid session, user is routed to signUp/login/guest screen automatically. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "A4SuKkXJ6AJTElFhd1PeB",
      "originalText": "User Story - Invalidate Session Token: \nAs An existing user\nI want to invalidate my session token, after a set amount of inactivity\nSo that if other people access the device, they can't log in passively on my account. \n\nAcceptance: firebase handles invaldation of session token in AsyncStorage. If user has an invalid session, user is routed to signUp/login/guest screen automatically. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "M7TMjH7b01CtA73gp5Qyd",
