      "text": "User Story - User Profile Setup: \nAs A User\nI want to be able to personify my own profile\nSo that i feel i have ownership over the usage of the app\n\nAcceptance: ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "M7TMjH7b01CtA73gp5Qyd",
      "originalText": "User Story - User Profile Setup: \nAs A User\nI want to be able to personify my own profile\nSo that i feel i have ownership over the usage of the app\n\nAcceptance: ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
