    {
      "id": "ZwXoAj3iO4PbQkqEGtBKA",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1490.8751525878906,
      "y": 1473.8916702270508,
      "width": 812.0166625976562,
      "height": 225,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff44f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1A",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1909110826,
      "version": 1087,
      "versionNonce": 1858100943,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1779181346160,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User Story - Log in exisisting user: \nAs An  exsisting user\nI want to authenticate myself\nSo that i can act as myself in the app\n\nAcceptance: a user provides an email and a password to firebase auth via\nsignInWithEmailAndPassword() in a login view. firebase returns a successfull\nuserCredential object. Our auth implementation also contains a reference to react\nnative AsyncStorage for persistence handling. User is then rerouted to home view. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "0uw4npwBbt1ieecSRALCQ",
      "originalText": "User Story - Log in exisisting user: \nAs An  exsisting user\nI want to authenticate myself\nSo that i can act as myself in the app\n\nAcceptance: a user provides an email and a password to firebase auth via signInWithEmailAndPassword() in a login view. firebase returns a successfull userCredential object. Our auth implementation also contains a reference to react native AsyncStorage for persistence handling. User is then rerouted to home view. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "YCI3evvrAVFm4wHftt4C0",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": 406.08353678385447,
      "y": 1117.154182434082,
      "width": 683.75,
      "height": 685,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff44f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
