      "updated": 1779782326703,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Start\n1. Should grab a new deck. \n2. Should randomly sort deck. \n3. Should fan out the tableau of cards, default 7 columns.\n4. Should take in a drawrule based on user choice. \n5. should adhere to drawrule when user draws from deck to waste.\n6. last item in each column turned face up. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ZQqJPtdxykivBRm-6aJg_",
      "originalText": "Game Start\n1. Should grab a new deck. \n2. Should randomly sort deck. \n3. Should fan out the tableau of cards, default 7 columns.\n4. Should take in a drawrule based on user choice. \n5. should adhere to drawrule when user draws from deck to waste.\n6. last item in each column turned face up. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "R_CUYwJCYDjwM2wSPNkbM",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -607.063732356887,
      "y": 2151.5971721869364,
      "width": 713.6701497360767,
      "height": 285,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
