      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Configuration Player Should Set Column Amount\nAs a player\nI want to set up the amount of column in the tableau\nTo customize the playing experince:\n\nImplementation. Game State at the start, should take in a\ngiven tableau column count, and dynamically set up tableau\nbased on column count and column calculation.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "sCsir-RyxzrCT6cxaV38o",
      "originalText": "Game Configuration Player Should Set Column Amount\nAs a player\nI want to set up the amount of column in the tableau\nTo customize the playing experince:\n\nImplementation. Game State at the start, should take in a given tableau column count, and dynamically set up tableau based on column count and column calculation.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
