      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779783192303,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Configuration Player should set draw rule for deck to\nwaste\nAs a player\nI want to decide on what draw rule should be valid in a\ngiven game.\nTo customize the playing experience\n\nImplementation: Game state on start should take in a given\ndraw rule adhering to a common draw rule interface, and\nconfigure the gameloop to adhere to the given game rule.\nStrategy Pattern?",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "6P8QS9ufig5EILpYnJfEW",
      "originalText": "Game Configuration Player should set draw rule for deck to waste\nAs a player\nI want to decide on what draw rule should be valid in a given game.\nTo customize the playing experience\n\nImplementation: Game state on start should take in a given draw rule adhering to a common draw rule interface, and configure the gameloop to adhere to the given game rule. Strategy Pattern?",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "ojEKMSqvGABRGLcGpvQyc",
