    {
      "id": "ztUY-8jOZNbVoJLwd_6bF",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -1305.2434425798779,
      "y": 2538.55630896025,
      "width": 561.5,
      "height": 350,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff44f",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1g",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1365160498,
      "version": 640,
      "versionNonce": 2016219698,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779783588028,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Action Player Can Move Card From Tableau To\nFoundation\n\nAs a player\nI want to move a valid face up card to it's suited\nfoundation\nTo win the game\n\nimplementation:\nThe player should be able to grab a face up card from\nthe tableau to it's matching foundation. Each foundation\nhas to be sorted, low to high. A Valid card is the next\nvalid card in the sorted list Ace -> King. \nIf A-H is in the H foundation, the next valid card is 2-H ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ojEKMSqvGABRGLcGpvQyc",
      "originalText": "Game Action Player Can Move Card From Tableau To Foundation\n\nAs a player\nI want to move a valid face up card to it's suited foundation\nTo win the game\n\nimplementation:\nThe player should be able to grab a face up card from the tableau to it's matching foundation. Each foundation has to be sorted, low to high. A Valid card is the next valid card in the sorted list Ace -> King. \nIf A-H is in the H foundation, the next valid card is 2-H ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "rZgiFNvnHRy2Wp2sijykv",
      "type": "rectangle",
      "x": -1311.7568990774182,
      "y": 2899.3798573820964,
      "width": 580.8108011059644,
      "height": 435,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#fff44f",
