      "updated": 1779785363168,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Action Fill Empty Tableau Column\n\nAs a player\nI want to place a king in an open tableau column\nIf no other cards are in said column\n\nImplementation:\nIf the player has removed all cards from a tableau column,\nthe player should be able to move a king of any suit into\nsaid column, to reestablish a sorting column in said tableau\ncolumn. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "wcrjNCEoBVOkdPSvedJg6",
      "originalText": "Game Action Fill Empty Tableau Column\n\nAs a player\nI want to place a king in an open tableau column\nIf no other cards are in said column\n\nImplementation:\nIf the player has removed all cards from a tableau column, the player should be able to move a king of any suit into said column, to reestablish a sorting column in said tableau column. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
