      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779785475967,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Action Flip WastePile into deck on empty deck.\n\nAs a player\nIf the deck is empty,\nAnd it's allowed by draw rules\nI want to pass the wastepile into the deck\nSo that i can continue flipping cards from the deck into\nwaste. \n\nImplementation:\nGiven the deck is empty, and that the draw rule's\nspesified pass count is not exceeded, a player should be\nable to place the waste pile into the deck without any\nsorting action. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "BJ_pd2TC5Q0fzdH7g-x9v",
      "originalText": "Game Action Flip WastePile into deck on empty deck.\n\nAs a player\nIf the deck is empty,\nAnd it's allowed by draw rules\nI want to pass the wastepile into the deck\nSo that i can continue flipping cards from the deck into waste. \n\nImplementation:\nGiven the deck is empty, and that the draw rule's spesified pass count is not exceeded, a player should be able to place the waste pile into the deck without any sorting action. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
