      "updated": 1779785611914,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Action There shall be no face down cards on top\nof any column in tableau.\nAs a player\nIf i have successfully freed a face down card in a\ntableau column. It should automatically turn face up. \n\nImplementation:\nIf a face down card is at the top of any tableau\ncolumn, it should automatically flip to face up state. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "NHSBLdZgGsYBMB_IOG7rz",
      "originalText": "Game Action There shall be no face down cards on top of any column in tableau.\nAs a player\nIf i have successfully freed a face down card in a tableau column. It should automatically turn face up. \n\nImplementation:\nIf a face down card is at the top of any tableau column, it should automatically flip to face up state. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
