      "updated": 1779785698359,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Action Check Game Over\nAs a player\nIf i have no more valid moves.\nThe game should end and i should recieve a game over.\n\nImplementation: After a move is taken by the player. \nThe game should scan any face up card for valid\nmoves. If none is found, including no draw action can\nbe done, the game changes to loss state. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "Wp17NOUTNJxeJEA-7tKZD",
      "originalText": "Game Action Check Game Over\nAs a player\nIf i have no more valid moves.\nThe game should end and i should recieve a game over. \n\nImplementation: After a move is taken by the player. \nThe game should scan any face up card for valid moves. If none is found, including no draw action can be done, the game changes to loss state. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
