      "updated": 1779785766320,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Game Action Check Game Won\nAs a player\nIf the top of all foundation slots are kings. \nI have won the game. \n\nImplementation: If a king is placed on top of a\nfoundation, if all foundation columns have a king at\nthe top, the game is marked as won. ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "SQti05lL9mxnaQqVQapGI",
      "originalText": "Game Action Check Game Won\nAs a player\nIf the top of all foundation slots are kings. \nI have won the game. \n\nImplementation: If a king is placed on top of a foundation, if all foundation columns have a king at the top, the game is marked as won. ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    }
